@startuml
title SYS-SEQ06  UC06 学生查看个人交易记录
skinparam backgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #111111
    LifeLineBorderColor #777777
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #7A8796
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #222222
    ActorBorderColor #7A8796
    ActorBackgroundColor #E7EEF8
    ActorFontColor #222222
    GroupBorderColor #F0A060
    GroupHeaderFontColor #333333
    GroupFontColor #333333
    ActivationBorderColor #5E6A78
    ActivationBackgroundColor #DCE8F8
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerBorderColor #999999
}

actor 学生用户 as Student
participant 校园二手交易平台 as System

group 打开个人交易工作台
    Student -> System : 请求查看个人交易记录
    activate System
    System -> System : 依据当前Session识别本人
    System -> System : 查询本人买入和卖出订单
    System --> Student : 返回本人交易工作台
    deactivate System
end

group 查看订单阶段和时间线
    Student -> System : 打开某笔订单详情
    activate System
    System -> System : 校验订单是否与当前用户相关
    alt 属于本人交易
        System --> Student : 返回订单阶段、关键时间和交易信息
    else 不属于本人交易
        System --> Student : 拒绝查看
    end
    deactivate System
end

group 查看个人待办
    Student -> System : 请求查看待处理交易
    activate System
    System -> System : 根据本人订单阶段整理待办
    System --> Student : 返回需要本人处理的交易事项
    deactivate System
end

group 按买入/卖出或阶段筛选
    Student -> System : 选择买入/卖出及阶段条件
    activate System
    System -> System : 仅在本人交易记录中筛选
    System --> Student : 返回筛选后的订单列表
    deactivate System
end
@enduml
